#!ipxe
# Copyright The Phorepoc Authors
# SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-2-Clause
#
# Served by the lab at /gpd/boot.ipxe. Boots the image the same way the UEFI ISO does: GRUB (x86_64-efi, built
# by build_ipxe.sh with grub.cfg embedded) loads phorepoc.elf through multiboot2 over HTTP, on iPXE's own
# network device (iPXE hands its SNP to the chained image, GRUB's efinet takes it).
chain --autofree http://${lab}/gpd/grubx64.efi
